    "summary_one_sentence": "When a Los Angeles to Shanghai flight crash-lands in shark-infested waters, the surviving international passengers must put aside their differences to escape their sinking plane before the surrounding predators strike.",
    "summary_short": "An international flight traveling from Los Angeles to Shanghai suffers a catastrophic mid-air emergency, forcing a crash landing directly into shark-infested ocean waters. Trapped inside the rapidly submerging fuselage, the terrified survivors face a dual threat as ocean water fills the cabin and blood in the water attracts a deadly shark frenzy. To survive the sinking wreckage and reach safety, this fractured group of strangers must overcome their personal conflicts and collaborate against the odds. It is a tense survival thriller where every second counts as the plane slips further into the depths.",
    "summary_long": "En route from Los Angeles to Shanghai, an airliner carrying a diverse group of international passengers encounters severe complications that lead to an emergency landing in remote ocean waters. The impact leaves the aircraft crippled and rapidly sinking, trapping the surviving passengers and crew inside the flooded fuselage. As panic sets in, the survivors quickly realize that the crash landing was only the beginning of their nightmare. Blood spilled during the crash leaks into the surrounding ocean, attracting a relentless swarm of hungry sharks to the site of the wreckage. Trapped between the encroaching water filling the cabin and the deadly apex predators circling outside, the group is forced into a desperate battle for survival. Internal tensions flare as fear and conflicting priorities threaten to tear the group apart from within. However, to execute any viable escape plan before the aircraft plunges completely into the deep trench below, they must learn to trust one another. Working together, they race against time to seal breaches, locate survival gear, and attempt a risky breakout into the open water. Ultimately, their resilience and unity are put to the ultimate test as they face the brutal realities of nature and the sinking ship.",
